  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen clicking on a Group Public or Group+ Instance on the website, you would normally expect there to be a Unlocked Link you can share with friends or others so that they can join. \n\nThis is currently not the case though. When clicking on a Group Public or Group+ you will get an \"Unlocked Link\", but this link just brings you to the world it self and not the Instance you are in.\n\n# Expected Behavior:  \n\nI would expect these to work similarly to how Public and Friends+ Instances work.\n\n1. Group Public:\n\n- When clicking on a Group Public Instance you should always be able to see / get the Unlocked Link as that's also how normal Public worlds work.\n\n2. Group+:\n\n- When clicking on Group+ you should be able to normally copy the Locked Link and generate an Unlocked Link if you want to (this is how Friends+ works)\n\n- Being able to get an Unlocked Link should either be locked behind a permission or be limited Group Members only\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere are pictures showcasing the issue:",
